                "value": "### Category guide\n\n| Category | Use it for |\n|---|---|\n| \ud83d\udd34 Complaint | Customer is unhappy with service, product or a previous contact |\n| \ud83d\udfe0 Billing / payment | Invoices, refunds, payment failures, pricing disputes |\n| \ud83d\udfe1 Technical support | Faults, outages, configuration help |\n| \ud83d\udfe2 Sales enquiry | New business, upgrades, quotes |\n| \ud83d\udd35 Account / profile change | Contact details, users, permissions, cancellations |\n| \ud83d\udfe3 General question | Anything informational that is not one of the above |\n| \u26ab Spam / junk | Unsolicited or automated mail - disconnect without reply |\n| \u26aa Other | Use sparingly and add a triage note |\n\nCategory, importance, follow-up flag and note are saved on the interaction as participant data (EmailCategory, EmailPriority, EmailFollowUp, EmailCategoryNote) so they can be reported on and used in Architect."
              },
              "fontSize": {
                "typeName": "integer",
                "value": 12
              },
              "ariaLive": {
                "typeName": "boolean",
                "value": false
              }
            }
          },
